sequenceDiagram

Actor VNODE_OPERATOR
participant MEMBER_CLUSTER as Memeber Cluster
participant NOTARY_CLUSTER   
participant PEER_CLUSTER   

VNODE_OPERATOR ->> MEMBER_CLUSTER: <<DF_FLOW_REQ>> <br/> RPC/api/v1/flow/$HOLDING_ID: "startFlow":<br/> { "clientRequestId": "r1", "flowClassName":<br/> "net.cordapp.testing.calculator.CalculatorFlow",<br/> "requestData": "{ \"a\":10, \"b\":20 }"}
MEMBER_CLUSTER ->> VNODE_OPERATOR: return status: START_REQUESTED

VNODE_OPERATOR ->> MEMBER_CLUSTER: <<DF_FLOW_STAT1>> <br/>RPC/api/v1/flow/$HOLDING_ID/r1
MEMBER_CLUSTER ->> VNODE_OPERATOR: return status: RUNNING

MEMBER_CLUSTER ->> MEMBER_CLUSTER: <<DF_SANDBOX_FINALIZE1>> <br/> Flow code: UtxoLedgerService.finalize (participant peer ID)

MEMBER_CLUSTER ->> PEER_CLUSTER: <<DF_P2P_RESPONDER_FLOW>> <br/> P2P session ResponserFlow.call via P2P
note over MEMBER_CLUSTER, PEER_CLUSTER: <<DF_ sendUnseenSignaturesToCounterparties>> Optional

opt Notarization protocol

MEMBER_CLUSTER ->> NOTARY_CLUSTER: <<DF_NV_NOTARIZATION_REQ>> <br/>Non validating TX Notarization <br/> (TX Id, Input TxIDs, State references, num of outputs, time window, notary ID) 
NOTARY_CLUSTER ->> NOTARY_CLUSTER: Notary checks (OK)<br/> UXTO Ledger update<br/>[...]
NOTARY_CLUSTER ->> MEMBER_CLUSTER: <<DF_NV_NOTARIZATION_RES>> <br/>return Notary signed TX 

alt Non validating notarization
MEMBER_CLUSTER ->> NOTARY_CLUSTER: <<DF_VAL_NOTARIZATION_REQ>> <br/>Validating TX Notarization <br/> (whole TX details, states ...) 
NOTARY_CLUSTER ->> NOTARY_CLUSTER: Notary checks (OK)<br/> UXTO Ledger update<br/>[...]
NOTARY_CLUSTER ->> MEMBER_CLUSTER: <<DF_VAL_NOTARIZATION_RES>> <br/>return Notary signed TX

end

alt Validation Notarization (optional, custom implementation)
MEMBER_CLUSTER ->> PEER_CLUSTER: <<DF_sendNotarySignaturesToCounterparties>> <br/> send Notary Signatures To Counterparties

end

end

VNODE_OPERATOR ->> MEMBER_CLUSTER: <<DF_FLOW_STAT1>> <br/>RPC/api/v1/flow/$HOLDING_ID/r1
MEMBER_CLUSTER ->> VNODE_OPERATOR: return status: COMPLETED

